---
---

<!-- Deploy: bg #f4f3ec, padding 96px 120px -->
<section style="background: #f4f3ec; padding: 96px 120px;">
  <div style="max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <!-- Heading -->
    <h2 class="reveal" style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -1px; color: #000000; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0;">
      Colleagues that work anywhere.
    </h2>

    <!-- Description -->
    <p class="reveal" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #5c5c5c; line-height: 1.6; margin: 16px 0 0 0; max-width: 800px;">
      Colleagues aren't limited to one surface. Eluu lets you deploy them wherever work happens — in Slack for your team, embedded in your product for customers, or running in the background through your API. Same platform, same memory, same abilities.
    </p>

    <!-- Deploy screenshot -->
    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top: 48px; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;">
      <img
        src="/images/deploy.png"
        alt="Deploy interface"
        style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Three text columns -->
    <div style="display: flex; padding: 78px 0 0 0; gap: 16px;">
      <div class="reveal" style="flex: 1;">
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.18px; color: #17100e; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">
          Internal teams
        </h3>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14.6px; color: #170f0d; line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 0 0;">
          Colleagues that live in Slack, work across your internal tools, and handle recurring work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="flex: 1;">
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.18px; color: #17100e; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">
          In your product
        </h3>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14.6px; color: #170f0d; line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 0 0;">
          Colleagues trained on your knowledge base and aware of each customer's context.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="flex: 1;">
        <h3 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.18px; color: #17100e; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">
          In your backend
        </h3>
        <p style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14.6px; color: #170f0d; line-height: 1.5; margin: 8px 0 0 0;">
          Colleagues that carry your brand into external environments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
